// REJECTS: no viable alternative at input 'AssociationMapping(~mainTable'
//
// An AssociationMapping body is property mappings and nothing else. It has no ~mainTable,
// no ~filter, no ~primaryKey: an association is mapped by the joins on its two ends, so
// there is no single main table for it to name.
//
// The relational grammar routes `associationMapping | classMapping` from one entry point,
// and the two share the whole property-mapping machinery -- so the modifier clauses are one
// rule away from being reachable here. A rewrite that parses "a relational mapping body"
// once and only afterwards asks whether it was an association accepts this.
###Mapping
Mapping fixture::neg::MainTableInAssociation
(
   fixture::neg::PersonFirm: Relational
   {
      AssociationMapping
      (
         ~mainTable [fixture::neg::Db]PERSON
         employees[firm_id, person_id]: [fixture::neg::Db]@PersonFirm
      )
   }
)
